  "id": "four_phases_crossing_the_river_to_check_the_king",
  "name": "Four Phases, Crossing the River to Check the King",
  "description": "A four-sided die used for simple checks. Can slightly level up Traces for Destruction characters.",
  "story": "The benefit of a four-sided die is that, if you believe in it, it will make every problem easy.\nComplex dilemmas, unsolvable games, and all those situations you have no idea how to handle — the hard part of it all lies in \"not knowing what the optimal solution is.\" We spend our whole lives with a desire to grasp the power to select, yet spend that same lifetime feeling the anxiety of potential regret.\nBut a four-sided die doesn't need to think about any of that. There is no optimal solution in the life of a die. In other words, in a die's life, all four sides are the optimal solution.\n\n\"So don't overthink it. No matter what you select, I will declare it: a great success.\"",
